================================================================================
5. Original work
================================================================================

Everything else in this repository is original to this project and carries no
third-party licence, including:

  - The wire protocol, in both TypeScript (`packages/protocol`) and Kotlin
    (`android/protocol`).
  - The gateway and the oblivious relay (`packages/server`).
  - The reference client (`packages/client`) and the Android client library
    (`android/client`).
  - The native self-protection library, `android/client/src/main/cpp/*` —
    written against the Android NDK and libc headers only, with no vendored
    third-party source.
  - The Android application module and its UI.

The cryptography is not original and is not meant to be: it is libsignal's.
This project supplies transport, storage, and the metadata design around it.
